  <page_number>482</page_number>
  <running_head>De Moderna / Num. Præceptor. Cap. VI.</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" type="heading" level="1" para="true">DEUTRONOMIUM.</l>
    <l n="2" para="true">Nemo sit judex nisi qui bene doctus est in lege etiam si in structus est in aliis humanioribus scientiis.</l>
    <l n="3" para="true">Non debet metuere judex impium hominem.</l>
    <l n="4" para="true">Non expectes aliquid proximi tui.</l>
    <l n="5" para="true">Debes unum Deum confiteri.</l>
    <l n="6" para="true">Amabis illum.</l>
    <l n="7" para="true">Discés legem &amp; alios docebis.</l>
    <l n="8" para="true">Leges illud caput, <i>Audi Israel</i>, &amp;c. e singulis diebus bis.</l>
    <l n="9" para="true">Alligabis oracula manui tuæ.</l>
    <l n="10" para="true">Alligabis frontalibus tuis.</l>
    <l n="11" para="true">Inscribes ea postibus domus tuæ.</l>
    <l n="12" para="true">Ne tentate Jehova.</l>
    <l n="13" para="true">Ne pangito fœdus cum gentibus profanis.</l>
    <l n="14" para="true">Non habebis misericordiam supra illas.</l>
    <l n="15" para="true">Non facies conubia cum illis.</l>
  </main_text>
